# mesh-text language catalogue (English).
# UTF-8 without BOM, LF line endings. Format: key = value.
# Lines starting with '#' are comments; blank lines are ignored. Key and value are trimmed;
# whitespace inside a value is preserved.
# A key is <crate>.<class>.<name>: crate is the short name without the mesh- prefix, and class
# is one of text/log/error/menu/notice.
# Placeholders are {0}, {1}, ... numbered consecutively from 0; no other braces are allowed.

